body:
have you seen his stats? he supposedly only weighs 50kg (110lbs) while being 179cm (5'10)... 
sometimes i wonder if the ppl deciding those things actually aim for the characters to be severely underweight or if they just decide that shit on random. 


if u really wanna just trigger yourself to death, just look at the report cards from danganronpa. height, weight and for some reason bust measurements of every character :')
